    "en": {
      "trackName": "Bloom Jump Watch",
      "description": "Bloom Jump is a classic 2D side-scrolling platformer with crisp pixel-art worlds and tight, responsive controls — easy to pick up, fun to master.\n\nRun, jump, and stomp your way through five hand-designed levels: Green Meadows, Rocky Cliffs, Sky Gardens, Dark Caves, and Final Heights. Collect coins and gems, bounce off springs, dodge spikes, and outsmart walkers, flyers, and chasers on your way to the flag.\n\nFEATURES\n• 5 hand-crafted levels with parallax pixel-art backgrounds\n• Smooth 60 FPS platforming with springs, one-way platforms, and stompable enemies\n• Coins, gems, and a flag goal in every level — three lives, three hearts\n• Original chiptune music and retro sound effects\n• Play your way: touch controls, game controller, or keyboard\n• Available in 13 languages\n\nPure, old-school platforming — no timers, no ads getting in your way. Just you, the jump button, and the next level. Grab your coins and reach the flag!",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/bloom-jump-watch/id6779528549?uo=4",
